    "For each password created or changed in Verrou (editor, Brave, import), Have I Been Pwned is queried in the background. Only the first 5 characters of its SHA-1 hash leave this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À chaque mot de passe créé ou modifié dans Verrou (éditeur, Brave, import), Have I Been Pwned est interrogé en arrière-plan. Seuls les 5 premiers caractères de son empreinte SHA-1 quittent ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por cada contraseña creada o modificada en Verrou (editor, Brave, importación), se consulta Have I Been Pwned en segundo plano. Solo salen de este Mac los 5 primeros caracteres de su hash SHA-1."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por cada contraseña creada o modificada en Verrou (editor, Brave, importación), se consulta Have I Been Pwned en segundo plano. Solo salen de este Mac los 5 primeros caracteres de su hash SHA-1."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per ogni password creata o modificata in Verrou (editor, Brave, importazione), Have I Been Pwned viene interrogato in background. Solo i primi 5 caratteri del suo hash SHA-1 lasciano questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
